# Copy to .env.local (gitignored via .gitignore's `*.local`) for `vite`/`pnpm dev`.
#
# M12 — Web Push (docs/05 §5: "the client bundle holds only the VAPID
# *public* key"). Public by nature — safe in a `VITE_*` var, unlike
# `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` (server-only, CLAUDE.md hard rule 6). Must be the exact
# public half of the Worker's `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` secret (`.dev.vars` locally)
# — generate both together with `node scripts/generate-vapid-keys.mjs`.
# Optional: the Notifications settings UI only renders its "Enable" button
# when this is set (src/client/lib/push.ts), same pattern as
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY.
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
